It's free, and it's not too far to walk here from there.

5
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:25,380
W: I guess you are right.

6
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:29,460
I could leave my car there and not have to worry about moving it again.

7
00:00:30,005 --> 00:00:30,320
M: You should.

8
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:33,340
I always do, and I haven't had any problems yet.
